  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Challenge 2 Change, SERDA - Challenge 2 Change</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utmaning att f&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndra, SERDA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Challenge 2.0 is aimed at providing mechanism for risk sharing capital supporting innovative business ideas in Bosnia and Herzegovina. Challenge 2.0 has a combined focus on economic growth, poverty reduction, CSR and innovation.

It is expected to support initiatives that directly contribute to job creation by assisting companies to grow and thus employ more people or gain higher value.  Specifically the project aims at supporting innovative business ideas, products or services that lead to increased employment, increased competitiveness and sustainable socio-economic development in Bosnia and Herzegovina.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xF6;r att stimulera insatser inom den privata sektorn till utveckling och fattigdomsbek&#xE4;mpning. Denna Challenge Fond, f&#xF6;r goda id&#xE9;er, inbjuder f&#xF6;retag att konkurrera om st&#xF6;d p&#xE5; samma s&#xE4;tt som forskare s&#xF6;ker medel fr&#xE5;n en forskningsstiftelse.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To encourage the private sectors&#x2019; contribution to development and poverty alleviation, Challenge Fund invites companies to compete for  support for good ideas in the same way that researchers apply for funds from a research foundation.</narrative>
  </description>
